+/*
+ * DiskAndroid: MMC device provided by the host application.
+ *
+ * The drive is attached over USB without a kernel driver, so there is no
+ * device node to open. The application registers a dc_host_api with
+ * aacs_set_host(); every MMC command libaacs issues (GET CONFIGURATION,
+ * REPORT KEY, SEND KEY, READ DISC STRUCTURE) is handed to it. The host sends
+ * it through its own read-only guard and logs it, including the raw sense
+ * data of failed commands.
